{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265orMo0dPZk1795676302.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>沙田路今早（26日）發生一宗驚險車禍，兩部私家車在行駛期間發生猛烈碰撞，導致其中一部撞至四輪朝天，另一部則翻側在路中。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-26-14h53m23s945.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nyOO7IScH51795676264.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>網上隨後流傳一段拍下事發經過的車Cam影片，畫面顯示一輛Tesla私家車當時沿沙田路高速行駛，期間突然橫越雙白線，並從後高速撞向一輛福士私家車。由於衝力巨大，兩部私家車在碰撞後雙雙失控撞向路邊水馬，現場即時水花四濺。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-26-14h53m25s298.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261zPB8tE6rF1795676276.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>救援人員接報趕抵現場處理，事件中「福士」私家車的姓張（65歲）女司機感到不適，而同車的姓郭（32歲）男乘客則報稱頭痛，幸兩人均保持清醒，隨即被送往沙田威爾斯親王醫院接受治理。另外，肇事Tesla的姓丘（37歲）男司機在意外中並無受傷，惟警員為其進行酒精呼氣測試後發現度數超標，他涉嫌「酒後駕駛」及「危險駕駛」被捕，目前正被警方扣留調查。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:03:05.631320+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T15:57:16.225269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:29.361599+00:00","content_hash":"1369a30b36358bc68d428ebf8bf796ad83823e59fed33478d10d8625d98e01f5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:03:05.631320+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}